
# Project Name - hospital responsive website

> Compassionate, world-class healthcare delivering advanced medical treatments across all major specialties. Our expert team of doctors is available 24/7 for emergency care and routine consultations. Book online appointments easily to access diagnostic labs, pharmacy services, and patient-first care. Dedicated to your health and well-being with state-of-the-art technology and verified safety standards.

![Project Screenshot](assets/images/screenshot.png)

## ✨ Features

* **Responsive Design:** Fully fluid layout that adapts seamlessly to mobile, tablet, and desktop screens using Bootstrap grid.

* **Modern UI Components:** Utilizes Bootstrap cards, modals, carousels, and navigation bars.

* **Custom Styling:** Enhanced custom CSS styles layered smoothly over Bootstrap defaults.

* **Cross-Browser Compatible:** Tested and optimized for modern web browsers (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge).

## 🛠️ Built With

* [HTML5](https://mozilla.org) - Markup language
* [CSS3](https://mozilla.org) - Styling and animations
* [Bootstrap 5](https://getbootstrap.com/) - CSS framework for responsive design
* [FontAwesome](https://fontawesome.com) - Icons

